  "_type_subtypes": [
    "TYPE -> the subtypes it allows; no subtype is always allowed. Strict: a type listed with none, or missing",
    "here, takes no subtype (there is no ALS / BOMB). Every type is listed. The department's code sheet",
    "(2026-10-07) gave ALARM .. MVA. Its subtype list runs in one alphabetical block per type, in type order:",
    "MVA's NOINJ, MVF (AIR .. TRUCK) and NOTIF (CAD .. WATER) follow that order. The RESCUE / SERVICE split of",
    "the last block (ANIMAL .. WEATHER), STRU (COMM, RESD) and RECALL (none) are proposals: to confirm with the",
    "department (type_subtypes_partial.confirm, shown in Settings until confirmed there). ALARM GAS is the",
    "department's atmospheric gas alarm: GAS-ATMOS is retired. GAS-LEAK / GAS-LINE are HAZARD's, GAS-ODOR /",
    "GAS-OUT INVEST's (the user's own additions)."
  ],
