  "_event_class": [
    "Emergency (Pending events, then Active events once units go: run card, dispatch) or non-emergency",
    "(Non-emergency events: notifications, road closures, hydrants; logged and tracked, no dispatch).",
    "Keys: TYPE/SUBTYPE, then */SUBTYPE (any type), then TYPE; the most specific wins; anything",
    "not matched is emergency. The operator can override it per event."
