  "_unit_statuses": [
    "The department's unit status codes (PCFD code sheet, 2026-10-07), in its order, with the names it gave",
    "(in sentence case) and its colors (read from a picture of its status list: approximate, adjust in Settings).",
    "The sheet shows CN, CE and DO in black, unreadable on the console's dark theme: a neutral light grey here.",
    "fg = the text color on a filled button, picked for contrast. role (what the store does with it): free = in",
    "service (clears the unit off its event; can be recommended), oos = can't be dispatched (clears it, asks why,",
    "never recommended), dispatched = set on dispatch, enroute / onscene = first time stamped (First Enroute /",
    "First On Scene). No role = committed. free_status: what Close event sets and a new unit starts in.",
    "THE ROLES ARE A BEST GUESS (confirm: the department to confirm, shown in Settings > Lists until edited or",
    "confirmed there). CN, CE, FR and NR are guessed as free: they clear the unit off its call like AV, logged",
    "under their own code. UNMANNED is not in the department's list: kept (old history uses it), keep or retire?"
  ],
