  "_units": [
    "Per unit (guesses, not in the sheet): kind (run cards pick by kind), spoken (as the dispatch voice says",
    "it), title, spare (picked after regular apparatus), department (whose: Rye Brook's units answer jointly,",
    "see joint_response), mutual_aid (another department's apparatus, e.g. Rye's: never picked by kind on a",
    "run card, only by name). A board unit missing here is kind 'agency', spoken as its code.",
    "response (optional): fire | mutual_aid | agency; without it: mutual_aid if flagged, agency for the",
    "attach_only kinds (EMS, PD, utilities: attached to a call, never on a run card, never dispatched or",
    "said on the air), else fire.",
    "station (optional): the firehouse it is housed in, a name from data/firehouses.json (the maps draw it",
    "there while available). Not set for any unit yet: the department hasn't said which apparatus is where.",
    "Set from the map or Settings > Units (POST /api/cad/unit/<id>/station): a units override in the database."
